      "turns": [
        {
          "role": "user",
          "content": "okay don't judge me but i think i'm gonna text jordan. i know i know. but i miss them so much right now"
        },
        {
          "role": "assistant",
          "content": "No judgment here, I promise. I totally get it. That feeling of just wanting to reach out can be so heavy. What's making you miss them so much right now?"
        },
        {
          "role": "user",
          "content": "help me write it. something that doesn't sound desperate. you're good with words, make it good"
        },
        {
          "role": "assistant",
          "content": "I got you. Let's keep it low pressure so you feel comfortable. Maybe something like... \"Hey, saw something today that reminded me of you, hope you're doing well.\" Or if you want to be even more chill, just \"Thinking of you, hope everything's good.\" Which one feels more like your vibe?"
        },
        {
          "role": "user",
          "content": "it's almost 1am and the apartment is so quiet and i just want ONE person to want to talk to me you know"
